; FARO - interior tileset: houses (Ines, Tomasa), shop, enfermeria, posada with kitchen.
; Used through res/metatiles_interior.mt (16x16; not compiled yet: the harness builds only metatiles.mt).
; Same VRAM slot as the exterior set (BG 84..255, base 84). Budget: <= 172 (GDD estimates ~130).
; Rooms are framed by VOID (black) metatiles; the top row of a room is WALL*; 2-high furniture (SHELF, BOOKS,
; STOVE, BED) put their top half on the wall row or the floor row as the metatile names say (_0x top, _1x bottom).
; 99 tiles. Generated from a script, then this file is the source of truth.

